== Walkthrough ==
The first thing you have to do in this chapter is pull the next lever, and try to remain in your spot until the crate falls down, then push the crate to the edge and jump across.

Continue moving right, and then you will see another person picking flowers in a bright light. Before you approach, you will get hit by a brain parasite and turned around. 
